Id: stor016w
Severity: WARN
Category: filesystem
Check: check_storage
Fix: Replace the bare allow with rules naming the permitted devices.
References: usbguard-rules.conf(5)
Controls: NIST MP-7; ISO 7.10

USBGuard's rules hold a bare 'allow': every USB device is
authorized, and the guard changes nothing. Replace it with rules
naming the permitted devices (allow with id, serial or parent
conditions), so unknown devices stay blocked.
